{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00539","headline":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 肃和 · 崔玄童","name":"郊庙歌辞 祭汾阴乐章 肃和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"聿修严配，展事禋宗。\n祥符宝鼎，礼备黄琮。\n[祝]词以信，明德惟聪。\n介兹景福，永永无穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔玄童","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}